{"id": "46096", "title": "寒潭鹤影", "author": "紫狂", "category": "都市言情", "count": 66, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/46/46096.htm", "intro": "紫狂自称“天生嗜血，下笔成狂”（《雨过桃花》作者后记），作品以重口味著称，对于残忍血腥的场景不加回避。他笔下美好的人物，大多数都无法逃脱被命运碾碎的结局，即使偶尔有希望的光芒闪现，也只会在更为深重的黑暗中黯然失色。但在黑暗和血腥的背后，却能感受到作者对于人性的追问、对于苦难的悲悯。而其情节本身，初看或许骇人，但掩卷深思时却会觉得，无论是历史中还是现实里，类似的事情想必是屡见不鲜的。", "base": "files/article/html/46/46096", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第01章", "file": "6275210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02章", "file": "6275211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03章", "file": "6275212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第04章", "file": "6275213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05章", "file": "6275214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第06章", "file": "6275215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07章", "file": "6275216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第08章", "file": "6275217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第09章", "file": "6275218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "6275219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "6275220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "6275221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "6275222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "6275223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "6275224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "6275225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "6275226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "6275227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "6275228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "6275229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "6275230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章", "file": "6275231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "6275232.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24章", "file": "6275233.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25章", "file":